0007: client.ts3TextureKeepAliveSec (internal 0013, TS3 only, opt-in, off): a filter for unforced ResourceCache_Trim 0x732E90 calls that keeps a texture entry until N s after Trim first saw it. Hook written only when the bytes match.

Applies after 0001-0006 on NVIDIAGameWorks/dxvk-remix f35b86a (bridge/ only).

diff --git a/bridge/src/client/client_options.h b/bridge/src/client/client_options.h
